<title>USA: MACC Private Equities sets stock dividend.</title>
<headline>MACC Private Equities sets stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>CEDAR RAPIDS, Iowa 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>MACC Private Equities Inc said it declared a dividend of one share of common stock for each ten shares of its common stock payable March 31, to shareholders of record on March 14.</p>
<p>The company said that this is its first dividend.</p>
</text>
